{"title": "Dibuli Prism-A4L", "parts": {"lead": "<p class=lead>Multi-sensor capture box from Dibuli with four global-shutter fisheye cameras and a 6-axis IMU, solved from the maker&#x27;s public example data at two exposures.</p><div class=chips><span class=chip>Global shutter</span><span class=chip>4 cameras</span><span class=chip>798 Hz IMU</span><span class=chip>Data not hosted</span></div><div class=vtabs role=group aria-label=\"Choose a run\"><button type=button data-vt=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\">1000 µs</button><button type=button data-vt=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">2000 µs</button></div>", "glance": "<div class=band><figure class=demo><video src=\"/media/hero/hero_dibuli_960.mp4\" poster=\"/media/hero/hero_dibuli_960.jpg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload=metadata></video><figcaption>Recovered by MVIS from the maker&#x27;s example data. The clip predates the values below.</figcaption></figure><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.18<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>85.3<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>+2.06<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>71.6<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div><div class=v data-v=\"1\" hidden><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.18<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>85.3<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>+2.67<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>71.7<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div>", "process": "<p>The solved path of the rig around the board. Press Play or drag the bar to follow the calibration. Camera images are left out to keep the page small.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=procplot id=\"proc0\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc0\"><button type=button>▶ Play</button><select class=\"mvis-progress-cam\" aria-label=\"Camera shown\"><option value=\"0\">